  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & A^3-4 A^2+A+21 I=0 \\\\ & \\operatorname{tr}(A)=4=5+6 \\Rightarrow b=-1 \\\\ & |A|=-21 \\\\ & -16+a=-21 \\Rightarrow a=-5 \\\\ & 2 a+3 b=-13\\end{aligned}$",
